# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime secrets & data - NEVER commit these.
#   issuer_key.bin       Ed25519 private key: can mint licences.
#   session_secret.bin   signs session tokens.
#   licenses.db          the licence database (user licences + HWIDs).
# On Render these are (re)generated on the persistent disk on first boot.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
authentication/data/
**/issuer_key.bin
**/issuer_public.bin
**/session_secret.bin
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
.env.*
*.token

